  SuitSprite: {fileID: 0}
  CardStory: "Spades2 feels like acid clawing its way up his throat like the world
    is closing in but the room is not smaller like a weight pressing against his
    back and his stomach suffocating and crushing and tearing him to pieces.\r\n\r\nBut
    I am not being torn apart. Why is there cold sweat like a million needles on
    Spades2\u2019s skin? I don\u2019t know what a needle is.\r\n\r\nMy eyes widen
    in the pane of glass, and my face goes white. I am him or close enough and he
    dreads the sight of it, I can taste it in his synapses, not obscured by the dreadful
    spikes the rest of the Order carry.\r\n\r\nSpades2 grabs a nearby chair and smashes
    the mirror. I forget what comes after."
